{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2021-11-08 13:41:00', 'title': "MCWHINNEY INKS LOVELAND DEAL WITH BOBO'S", 'text': "LOVELAND, COLO., NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCWHINNEY, COLORADO-BASED REAL ESTATE INVESTOR AND DEVELOPER WITH EXPERTISE IN COMMERCIAL, MIXED-USE, HOSPITALITY, MULTIFAMILY AND RESIDENTIAL ASSETS AND MASTER DEVELOPER OF CENTERRA\xa0IN LOVELAND, ANNOUNCED THAT BOBO'S\xa0HAS SIGNED A LEASE FOR THE ENTIRETY OF BUILDING 7, A 123,000 SQUARE FOOT INDUSTRIAL FACILITY LOCATED WITHIN CENTERRA."}